<h2 style="text-align: center;"> </h2>
<h2 style="text-align: center;">Our Advisory Board Members</h2>
<p>The Birmingham Alabama Area Command advisory board consists of a wide spectrum of hard-working men and women who share in the vision to transform and restore lives in the Greater Birmingham Area.</p>
