<section id="Accordion" class="migration-component py-5">
<div class="container">
<div class="accordion my-3" id="accordion-8a808034">
<div class="accordion-item">
<h2 class="accordion-header" id="heading-8a808034-1"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse-8a808034-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-8a808034-1"> Echelon Junior Board </button></h2>
<div id="collapse-8a808034-1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="heading-8a808034-1" data-bs-parent="#accordion-8a808034">
<div class="accordion-body">
<h2 style="text-align: center;">Who We Are</h2>
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 20px;">Echelon: Elevating Communities with The Salvation Army</span></strong></p>
<p>Welcome to Echelon, a dynamic and passionate community of young professionals dedicated to making a positive impact on the world through The Salvation Army. Echelon is not just a network; it's a movement, a force for good, and an opportunity to be part of something greater than yourself.</p>
<p>Echelon seeks to mobilize the next generation for The Salvation Army by providing opportunities for young adults to engage with the organization through fellowship and networking, donations and fundraising, and service and volunteering.</p>
<p>Echelon members participate in a variety of networking, volunteer, and fundraising activities. These activities directly support Salvation Army services within a chapter’s local community. Whether we are serving, attending one of our social events, or raising money, you will find Echelon is a connected community full of people who are making a difference. </p>
<p><strong>Our Mission:</strong><br>Echelon is committed to supporting The Salvation Army's vital work in communities across the globe. Our mission is clear: we aim to elevate the lives of those in need by raising awareness, volunteering our time, and fundraising to support critical programs and initiatives.</p>
<p><strong>What We Do:</strong><br>As an Echelon member, you'll have the chance to:</p>
<p>Connect with Purpose: Join a diverse group of like-minded individuals who share a passion for service and philanthropy.</p>
<p>Make a Difference Locally and Globally: Through fundraising events, volunteer opportunities, and advocacy efforts, we directly impact the lives of those who need it most.</p>
<p>Develop Leadership Skills: Echelon provides a platform for personal and professional growth, fostering leadership and teamwork.</p>
<p>Foster Lasting Relationships: Build meaningful connections with fellow members, forging friendships and professional networks that can last a lifetime.</p>
<p><strong>Why Join Echelon:</strong><br>When you become an Echelon member, you become a part of a powerful force for good. Your involvement translates into tangible, positive change in communities facing challenges such as homelessness, hunger, addiction, and disaster recovery.</p>
<p><strong>Get Involved:</strong><br>Ready to be a force for change? Join Echelon and discover the joy of giving back while connecting with others who share your commitment to making the world a better place.</p>
<p>Together, we amplify our impact, create lasting change, and elevate communities. Join Echelon and be part of a movement that stands for compassion, service, and social responsibility. Your journey of impact begins here.</p>
<p>For more information on serving with Echelon, please contact Renae Dismuke at <a href="mailto:Renae.Dismuke@uss.SalvationArmy.org" target="">Renae.Dismuke@uss.SalvationArmy.org</a> or call <a href="tel: 205-328-0743"> 205-328-0743 </a>. </p>
